      "statement": "Data lineage: upstream sources are the FX Rates API (API-13), sanctions screening and the Fraud Risk Signals API (API-08); downstream consumers are Fedwire, SWIFT, the general ledger and the Treasury Liquidity Positions API (API-15).",
